Sliding window

Index:     0   1   2   3   4   5   6
Array:    [4,  2,  1,  7,  8,  1,  2]

🔍 Step 1: Window starts at index 0 to 2 (size = 3)

           ↓   ↓   ↓
Index:     0   1   2   3   4   5   6
Array:    [4,  2,  1,  7,  8,  1,  2]
